  "findings": [
    "Compound native views need recursive native display and original child hit testing; flat root drawRect does not draw their children.",
    "Existing native backing readback is logical-sized; optional device-density readback shares its implementation and returns exact surface pixels.",
    "Native window display flags distinguish visible display work from clipped child invalidations.",
    "Transient menus query their ordinary window pointer before tracking begins; native item-add/tracking notifications bind both original native windows to the owner input stream.",
    "Unmapped backings cannot receive compositor position acknowledgements. Shared backend move handling now reports its already authoritative stored geometry; real menu captures must corroborate native state.",
    "A fresh empty toolbar differs from an emptied existing toolbar; compare the same native lifecycle. Reference double-painting is a fixture error, not a reason to change native drawing.",
    "The standalone helper must enable SO_PASSCRED on its listener before accept; otherwise a first queued registration can report sender PID zero. Session-owned listeners already do this. Keep owner validation unchanged."
  ],
